# docker/Dockerfile builds from the repository root. Allowlist: the build context holds only what the build needs,
# so secrets (.env), terrain data and local files never reach it. docker/ci.Dockerfile uses bin/ as its context.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!web/

# Built by the web stage of the Dockerfile, or installed there
internal/webui/dist
**/node_modules
web/.svelte-kit
